Third-Party Notices for askdo
==================================

askdo is distributed as two Go executables (`askdo` and `askdo-launch`).
The complete set of non-standard-library packages compiled into that
pair (verified with `go list -deps ./cmd/askdo ./cmd/askdo-launch`) belongs to the
modules listed below. The full requirement graph (`go mod graph`)
additionally names test-only/tooling requirements of these modules (for
example modernc.org/cc, github.com/creack/pty, github.com/google/go-cmp);
those packages are NOT compiled into or shipped with the askdo binaries.

